<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ABN AMRO started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ABN AMRO started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex Brown said on Monday it initiated coverage of ABN AMRO Holdings NV with a buy rating.  </p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged at 19-1/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
